&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside our SaaS Platform Account Executives as the team&#39;s dedicated hunter for the earliest stage of the market. You&#39;ll own the pre-revenue and early-revenue segment end to end, from generating pipeline and handling inbound demand to closing deals and getting each new platform to activation and progressing revenue on Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Early-stage platforms make their payments decision early and rarely revisit it, and they often need several products from the start: embedded payments, onboarding connected accounts, payouts, and monetisation. Winning them early, and selling the right solution, gives Stripe a lasting position with the platforms that will scale fastest. This is a high-velocity sales role with short cycles, a high volume of opportunities, and plenty of competitive deals.&lt;/p&gt;
