&lt;h2 id=&quot;who-we-are&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-stripe&quot;&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-the-team&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Dublin, this role is a central piece of our dedicated Irish team focused exclusively on accelerating domestic commerce across Ireland. You will act as a critical growth partner to an incredible portfolio of Irish brands across diverse sectors—helping them navigate scaling challenges, unlock product value, and expand both domestically and globally. If you want to play a pivotal role in strengthening Stripe’s footprint in Ireland while directly empowering the next generation of Irish business success stories, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll manage a portfolio spanning high-profile SMB customers and the broader Commercial segment. You’ll own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and closing new business to managing existing relationships and identifying opportunities to expand Stripe’s footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll execute account and sales strategies, engage internal and external stakeholders, align technical and business requirements with product teams, demonstrate value in competitive situations, lead commercial negotiations, and close deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;responsibilities&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with existing SMB and Commercial Stripe customers to develop and execute long-term strategies that expand Stripe’s revenue and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle, from business-case development, deal structuring, and negotiation through to close and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a named account list and develop account plans to win and expand business with high-growth technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop targeted outbound strategies to create and nurture new opportunities across your portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive deal strategy and commercial negotiations for large or complex new business opportunities, expansions, and renewals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with executive stakeholders across your book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map accounts and coordinate effective meetings with the appropriate internal and external stakeholders to deepen and expand customer relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate opportunities of varying size and complexity, balancing velocity across the broader Commercial segment with a highly consultative approach for high-profile SMB accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with cross-functional teams to align customers’ technical and business requirements with Stripe’s products and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and contribute to team projects that develop and refine our sales processes and help shape Stripe’s sales culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;who-you-are&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;minimum-requirements&quot;&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of sales experience, preferably selling a highly technical product, with a track record of strong performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a varied portfolio and progressing opportunities with different levels of size, complexity, and sales-cycle length.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand technical requirements and craft solutions across multiple products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to develop and execute account plans spanning multiple business units within complex organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A knack for working effectively with a wide range of people, both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills, particularly for in-person meetings involving multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex negotiations involving bespoke commercial agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superior verbal and written communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in technology and a deep understanding of the space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 id=&quot;who-we-are&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-stripe&quot;&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;about-the-team-and-what-youll-do&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The UK Commercial New Business team focuses on acquiring new mid-market customers (companies with 100 to 1,000 employees). This team of core AE’s are responsible for selling the full suite of Stripe products, acting as the primary point of contact for prospective new users. This team works closely with cross-functional teams including product sales specialists, solution architects, channel &amp;amp; alliances, deal pricing, SDR and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, you’ll source and close new business, execute outbound pipeline generation with support from sales development representatives and field marketing, and run end-to-end sales cycles to bring new customers onto Stripe. You’ll play a critical role in expanding Stripe’s reach by identifying high-potential prospects and converting them into long-term users of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;responsibilities&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-potential prospective users and use effective prospecting strategies to generate pipeline that drives net-new revenue growth in your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement sales strategies to acquire new customers and drive adoption of Stripe products across new accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and understand users’ pain points, propose Stripe solutions, and own the full sales cycle from business case development to close and activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with prospective users to understand their priorities and guide them through the sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to solve user pain points and improve our product to better serve new customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;who-you-are&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a high-performing, well-rounded, AI-fluent seller with proven new-business sales experience. AEs who thrive in this role enjoy building, have a structured approach to pipeline generation, and have demonstrated success dealing with ambiguity and operating in a high-growth environment. If you&#39;re hungry, persistent, and willing to roll up your sleeves to build the plane while we’re flying it, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;minimum-requirements&quot;&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B new-logo sales experience, preferably selling a technical product or service at an API-first company, with a record of top performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of leading complex, multi-party, consultative sales processes from inception to close, including negotiations involving bespoke commercial agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong listening skills and the ability to understand complex technical problems, position Stripe solutions, and become a trusted resource for decision-makers across technology and finance organizations within software companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, verbal, and written communication skills, along with a disciplined approach to customer relationship management hygiene, forecasting, and communicating weekly and quarterly sales metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to operate effectively in a highly ambiguous, fast-paced environment, with a strong interest in technology, a deep understanding of the space, and persistence when encountering internal or external blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high potential candidate to join Stripe’s Alliances and Channels (A&amp;amp;C) team as a Channel Sales Executive. The Channel Sales Executive (CSE) is a key part of the Alliances and Channels team, supporting platform partners that embed Stripe technology into their solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a dynamic Channel Sales professional to drive business growth with a portfolio of SaaS Platforms. You will identify high-value opportunities, develop demand with these platforms, and foster new business within our partner ecosystem. Working closely with Partner Development Managers and Stripe Account Executives, you will be responsible for delivering incremental growth of new users and revenue through your portfolio.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive joint go-to-market and co-selling initiatives with a designated and diverse portfolio of SaaS platforms in a channel sales motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with platform counterparts to drive net new demand for partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable Stripe and partner sales teams on the joint value proposition and lead account mapping workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute sales strategies to expand Stripe’s revenue with strategic platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the full deal cycle with partners, from sourcing new pipeline, opportunity progression to closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an advocate for partners within Stripe, representing Stripe within the partner&#39;s organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate sales and partner activities in Salesforce.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Who you are&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of technology sales experience with a proven track record of exceeding sales targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the payments, commerce, and/or Q2C landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales experience working in multi-party sales pursuits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to speak to functional leadership both internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and be a team player on cross-functional deal pursuit teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel (25%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build and execute territory and opportunity-specific plans leveraging tools such as Salesforce and Crossbeam.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Airbnb was born in 2007 when two hosts welcomed three guests to their San Francisco home, and has since grown to over 5 million hosts who have welcomed over 2 billion guest arrivals in almost every country across the globe. Every day, hosts offer unique stays and experiences that make it possible for guests to connect with communities in a more authentic way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Community You Will Join:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our world-class Global Foundation Recruiting team, renowned for its dedication to excellence and innovation in talent acquisition. We are a dynamic, fun and passionate group, committed to building a diverse and high-performing workforce that propels our mission forward. As we navigate the ever-evolving landscape of our business, we pride ourselves on our collaborative approach, working closely with leaders globally to shape their hiring strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is focused on attracting the best talent of this generation, ensuring that we not only meet our strategic goals but also foster an inclusive environment where every individual can thrive, have fun and support each other. Together, we are setting the standard for recruiting excellence at Airbnb.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Difference You Will Make:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibility will be to successfully bring searches to fruition and deliver exceptional experiences for candidates and hiring managers across our CBO function, with additional support for hiring across our corporate functions. Our team takes a consultative approach, working closely with stakeholders to understand their needs and provide tailored solutions. Dedicated to sourcing and hiring top talent in the market, we ensure that every individual interacting with Airbnb&#39;s recruitment process feels valued and supported.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Typical Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and drive a full-cycle recruitment process including sourcing, screening, interview, feedback and offers for all levels of candidates from entry to senior level — across our CBO function (sales, business development, partnerships and other commercial/revenue-generating roles) and our corporate functions (such as Finance, Legal, People, Marketing and Communications).&lt;br&gt;Build pipeline for multiple requisitions across both CBO and corporate teams and geographies, flexing your approach to meet the needs of each function and establishing a strong diverse top of funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with talent partners, hiring managers, talent operations and finance to build hiring strategy and plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence business leaders and educate hiring managers on process, interview best practices, and decision making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide exceptional, high-touch &quot;white glove&quot; candidate experiences and create new ways to surprise and delight candidates as they go through our interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately track candidate data and use systems correctly to be able to report to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find the best, and most passionate people for Airbnb using new and creative ways to find and engage them, while operating with speed in a high-velocity requisition environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Airbnb with integrity and professionalism. Speak passionately and authentically about Airbnb and our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 - 7+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, with proven success recruiting for both revenue-generating roles (Sales, Business Development, Partnerships) and corporate/G&amp;amp;A functions (Finance, Legal, People, Marketing, Communications). You&#39;re comfortable moving between very different talent markets and calibrating a new hiring bar quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a high-velocity, high-volume recruiting environment, able to manage a large, fast-moving requisition load while maintaining a high bar and speed to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting across international markets in EMEA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to deliver a &quot;white glove,&quot; high-touch experience for senior, stakeholders and candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record for successfully identifying, qualifying, and closing exceptional candidates in competitive, quota-carrying, or commercial talent markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of sales/BD compensation structures (base, OTE, commission) and what motivates commercial talent, in order to effectively assess and sell candidates on the opportunity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with a demonstrated ability to communicate complex concepts concisely and clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well-developed analytical and influencing skills; comfortable partnering directly with revenue and business leaders on hiring strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates a positive, can do attitude. Receives feedback well and looks to constantly improve and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with a high degree of ambiguity in a fast-scaling, environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational, planning skills and a solutions orientation - able to juggle multiple concurrent, time-sensitive searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity and strong desire to continuously learn and grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-level of self-initiative, creativity, perseverance, and flexibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment To Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&g

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;From Fivetran’s founding until now, our mission has remained the same: to make access to data as simple and reliable as electricity. With Fivetran, customer data arrives in their warehouses, canonical and ready to query, with no engineering or maintenance required. We’re proud that more organizations continue to leverage our technology every day to become truly data-driven.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran and dbt Labs are bringing together two industry-leading companies with a shared mission: helping organizations unlock the full value of their data.&lt;br&gt;Together, we’re delivering the data infrastructure layer that helps organizations move, transform, and trust their data — from the moment data moves, through every transformation, to the context teams and AI systems rely on.&lt;br&gt;Fivetran helps organizations automate data movement across the systems, clouds, engines, and tools they rely on. dbt Labs pioneered analytics engineering, helping teams transform data into reliable, governed insights. Together, we support thousands of organizations as they build a trusted foundation for analytics, AI, and better business decisions.&lt;br&gt;As we bring our teams and technology together, we’re building on the strengths of both companies while continuing to deliver the products and experiences our customers know and trust. It’s an exciting time to join us: we’re creating a company with the scale, talent, and technology to help more organizations put their data to work with greater speed, confidence, and impact.&lt;br&gt;During this transition period, you may see references to both Fivetran and dbt Labs throughout our recruiting process as we integrate our teams, systems, and career sites.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fivetran is building data pipelines to power the modern data stack for thousands of companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #494949;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a talented&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;German speaking&lt;span style=&quot;color: #494949;&quot;&gt; Senior Sales Engineer to join our Enterprise sales team. As an Enterprise Sales Engineer, you will work closely with our sales team to understand our Enterprise customers’ complex business needs and showcase how Fivetran’s data replication solutions can help them achieve their desired business outcomes. You will be responsible for providing technical expertise, identifying technical requirements, and ensuring a successful proof-of value throughout the sales cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a full-time remote position based out of Ireland.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technologies You’ll Use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AWS, GCP, Azure, Snowflake, BigQuery, Databricks, New Relic, Linux, Windows, Python, Java&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Enterprise customers to understand their business, their use cases, and their data replication requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver technical presentations to Enterprise audiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure the technical win by running an organized proof-of-value process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73) !important; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(73, 73, 73); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work closely with multiple cross-fuctional organizations driving change and improvements to Fivetran as a whole.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
