&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research &amp;amp; Insights: &lt;/strong&gt;Conduct on-the-ground market research across Europe, surfacing consumer and competitive insights that inform product and marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Channel Identification: &lt;/strong&gt;Work across the organization to unlock new channels and partners to grow meaningfully.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We’re Looking For&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
