&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in a matrixed structure, and influencing outcomes without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with new entity creation and creation of complete employee lifecycle processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Global HR Transformation: strategy, design, and transition of People Operations to create value for the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of labour regulations, GDPR requirements and best practices to help ensure Toast remains compliant&lt;/li&gt;
